  <postToolChangeScript />
  <processChangeScript />
  <endingScript>; Wanhao Duplicator 9 end G-code|M104 S0 ; nozzle heater off|M140 S0 ; bed heater off|M107 ; fan off|G91 ; relative moves|G1 E-2 F1500 ; release the pressure in the nozzle|G1 Z10 F300 ; lift the nozzle|G90 ; absolute moves|G1 X5 Y290 F3000 ; bring the bed to the front|M84 X Y E ; motors off, Z keeps its position</endingScript>
